WEBVTT

00:04:57.130 --> 00:05:01.497
So there's been a lot of interesting
partnerships and collaborations

00:05:01.530 --> 00:05:03.930
to really address this global challenge.

00:05:03.963 --> 00:05:06.830
So I think this has been
a really good effort

00:05:06.863 --> 00:05:09.697
and a great collective effort.

00:05:10.063 --> 00:05:11.263
Amidst all this,

00:05:11.297 --> 00:05:15.697
I also wanted to pitch
for what the Indian vaccine industry

00:05:15.730 --> 00:05:17.430
has done for the world.

00:05:18.997 --> 00:05:22.297
If you remember, in the early
stages of the pandemic,

00:05:22.330 --> 00:05:27.863
we had Indian companies really starting
to invest in vaccine development.

00:05:28.930 --> 00:05:32.263
Our largest vaccine maker,
Serum Institute,